flowchart TD
  %% INGESTION
  A[Web Article URL] --> B[Download HTML]

  B --> C[Store Raw HTML]
  B --> D[Extract Clean Text]

  D --> P1[Paragraph Splitter]

  P1 --> P2[Paragraph 1]
  P1 --> P3[Paragraph 2]
  P1 --> P4[Paragraph N]

  P2 --> E[Sentence Splitter]
  P3 --> E
  P4 --> E

  E --> F1[Sentence 1]
  E --> F2[Sentence 2]
  E --> F3[Sentence N]

  F1 --> G[Store Sentences Table]
  F2 --> G
  F3 --> G

  G --> H[Create Overlapping Chunks]

  H --> I1[Chunk 1<br/>Sentences 1-3]
  H --> I2[Chunk 2<br/>Sentences 3-5]
  H --> I3[Chunk N]

  I1 --> J[Generate Embedding]
  I2 --> J
  I3 --> J

  J --> K[(Vector Database)]

  C --> L[(Documents Table)]
  G --> M[(Sentences Table)]
  H --> N[(Chunks Table)]
  P1 --> O1[(Paragraphs Table)]

  %% RETRIEVAL
  O2[User Query] --> P[Generate Query Embedding]

  P --> K

  K --> Q[Top Matching Chunks]

  Q --> R[Chunk Metadata]

  R --> S[Find Original Sentences]

  M --> S
  L --> S
  O1 --> S

  S --> T[Expand Context<br/>Previous + Next Sentences]

  T --> U[Evidence Block]

  U --> V[LLM Answer Generation]

  V --> W[Answer + Citation]